1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:01,242
Look at how the book opens.

2
00:00:01,264 --> 00:00:06,420
This is the record of the genealogy of Jesus Christ, the son of David, the son of Abraham.

3
00:00:07,117 --> 00:00:22,384
The long list of names is not a preface. It establishes with authority who Jesus is and what is being fulfilled. Son of Abraham. That is the family through whom God promised to bless every nation on earth. Son of David. That is the family of Israel’s king.

